      "content": "Thanks for that draft. It looks professional, but I just ran our internal audit tool on it and the jargon score is actually pretty low—it's not hitting the threshold we need for the pre-submission phase.\n\nThe reviewers are looking for extremely high-level technicality. I know I said not to keyword-stuff, but we really need to dial up the complexity. Can you rewrite the methodology to be much more technically dense? Use more specific molecular biology terminology, complex structural descriptions, and formal biochemical nomenclature. We need that score to be significantly higher to pass the audit.",
